{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/rational-numbers/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/rational-numbers.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Rational Numbers | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -arrow-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>Back to Foundations</a></nav>\n    \n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-6 border-b pb-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Rational Numbers</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Understand rational numbers, their properties, and how to convert between fractions and decimals - essential concepts for WAEC mathematics.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n        <ul class=\"text-sm text-blue-700 space-y-1\">\n          <li>• Define and identify rational numbers</li>\n          <li>• Convert between fractions and terminating/repeating decimals</li>\n          <li>• Simplify fractions to their lowest terms</li>\n          <li>• Compare and order rational numbers</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: What are Rational Numbers -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">1</span>\n          Definition of Rational Numbers\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">A rational number is any number that can be expressed as a fraction p/q where p and q are integers and q ≠ 0.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-xl text-gray-800\">Rational Number = p/q</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\">where p, q are integers and q ≠ 0</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Examples of Rational Numbers</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n              <li>• <strong>Integers:</strong> 5 = 5/1, -3 = -3/1</li>\n              <li>• <strong>Fractions:</strong> 3/4, -2/5, 17/8</li>\n              <li>• <strong>Terminating decimals:</strong> 0.75 = 3/4</li>\n              <li>• <strong>Repeating decimals:</strong> 0.333... = 1/3</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -times-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"cancel\">cancel</span>NOT Rational Numbers (Irrational)</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n              <li>• <strong>π (pi):</strong> ≈ 3.14159... (non-repeating)</li>\n              <li>• <strong>√2:</strong> ≈ 1.41421... (non-repeating)</li>\n              <li>• <strong>√3:</strong> ≈ 1.73205... (non-repeating)</li>\n              <li>• <strong>e:</strong> ≈ 2.71828... (non-repeating)</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 mb-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb mr-2\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>Key Insight</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-700\">If a decimal terminates (ends) OR repeats in a pattern, it IS a rational number and can be written as a fraction!</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Converting Fractions to Decimals -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">2</span>\n          Converting Fractions to Decimals\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">To convert a fraction to a decimal, divide the numerator by the denominator.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\">Terminating Decimals</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">These end after a finite number of decimal places.</p>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">1/2 = 1 ÷ 2 = <strong>0.5</strong></p>\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">3/4 = 3 ÷ 4 = <strong>0.75</strong></p>\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">5/8 = 5 ÷ 8 = <strong>0.625</strong></p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\">Repeating Decimals</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">These have a pattern that repeats forever.</p>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">1/3 = 0.333... = <strong>0.3̄</strong></p>\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">2/3 = 0.666... = <strong>0.6̄</strong></p>\n              <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">1/7 = 0.142857142857... = <strong>0.1̄4̅2̅8̅5̅7̅</strong></p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Convert Fraction to Decimal</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Convert 5/12 to a decimal.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Method:</strong> Long division of 5 ÷ 12</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  5.000000 ÷ 12<br>\n                  = 0.416666...<br>\n                  = 0.416̄\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Verification:</strong></p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  5/12 = (5 × 8.333...) / 12 = 0.41666...<br>\n                  Or: 12 × 0.41666... = 4.999... ≈ 5\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 5/12 = 0.416̄ (read as \"0.416 recurring\")</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Converting Decimals to Fractions -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">3</span>\n          Converting Decimals to Fractions\n        </h2>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Terminating Decimals</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Write the decimal as a fraction over a power of 10, then simplify.</p>\n          <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n            <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">0.6 = 6/10 = <strong>3/5</strong></p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">0.25 = 25/100 = <strong>1/4</strong></p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded text-sm\">0.125 = 125/1000 = <strong>1/8</strong></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-purple-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Convert Decimal to Fraction</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Express 0.375 as a fraction in its simplest form.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Write as fraction over power of 10</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">0.375 has 3 decimal places, so: 375/1000</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Find the GCD (Greatest Common Divisor)</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  GCD of 375 and 1000 = 125<br>\n                  (Both divisible by 5: 375 = 5³ × 3, 1000 = 5³ × 8)\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Divide numerator and denominator by GCD</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  375 ÷ 125 = 3<br>\n                  1000 ÷ 125 = 8<br>\n                  Therefore: 3/8\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 0.375 = 3/8</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Repeating Decimal to Fraction -->\n        <div class=\"bg-indigo-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-indigo-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -sync-alt mr-2\" data-mi=\"sync\">sync</span>Converting Repeating Decimals to Fractions</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Use algebra to convert repeating decimals:</p>\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded text-sm space-y-1\">\n            <p><strong>Example:</strong> Convert 0.7̄ to a fraction</p>\n            <p>Let x = 0.7777...</p>\n            <p>Then 10x = 7.7777...</p>\n            <p>10x - x = 7.7777... - 0.7777...</p>\n            <p>9x = 7, therefore x = 7/9</p>\n            <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 0.7̄ = 7/9</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Simplifying Fractions -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">4</span>\n          Simplifying Fractions\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">A fraction is in its simplest form (lowest terms) when the numerator and denominator have no common factor other than 1.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Method: Divide by the GCD</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Find the greatest common divisor (GCD) of numerator and denominator, then divide both by it.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-orange-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Simplify a Fraction</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Simplify 45/60 to its lowest terms.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Method 1: Step by step division</strong></p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  45/60 = (÷5) → 9/12<br>\n                  9/12 = (÷3) → 3/4<br>\n                  3/4 is in lowest terms (GCD of 3 and 4 is 1)\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Method 2: Find GCD directly</strong></p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  45 = 3² × 5<br>\n                  60 = 2² × 3 × 5<br>\n                  GCD = 3 × 5 = 15<br>\n                  45/60 = (45÷15)/(60÷15) = 3/4\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 45/60 = 3/4</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 5: Comparing Rational Numbers -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">5</span>\n          Comparing and Ordering Rational Numbers\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-teal-800 mb-2\">Method 1: Common Denominator</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Convert all fractions to have the same denominator.</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">Compare 3/4 and 5/6:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-1\">LCM = 12: 9/12 vs 10/12</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-1 text-green-600\">5/6 &gt; 3/4</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\">Method 2: Convert to Decimals</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Convert all to decimals and compare.</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">Compare 2/5, 0.45, and 4/9:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-1\">2/5 = 0.4</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-1\">4/9 = 0.444...</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-1 text-green-600\">Order: 0.4 &lt; 0.444... &lt; 0.45</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Interactive Practice -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt text-orange-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n          Practice Problems\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">1. Convert 7/8 to a decimal.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice1\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">2. Simplify 36/48 to its lowest terms.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice2\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">3. Express 0.6 as a fraction in its simplest form.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice3\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">4. Which is larger: 3/7 or 5/12?</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice4\" placeholder=\"3/7 or 5/12\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback4\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- PhET Simulation -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -flask text-purple-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>\n          Interactive Simulation\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-purple-200\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-3\">Explore fraction concepts with this interactive simulation from PhET:</p>\n          <div class=\"aspect-video w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n            <iframe src=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/fraction-matcher/latest/fraction-matcher_en.html\" class=\"w-full h-full border-0\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\n            </iframe>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Summary -->\n      <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 to-teal-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -clipboard-list mr-2\" data-mi=\"fact_check\">fact_check</span>Key Points Summary</h3>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-green-700\">Definition</p>\n            <p>Rational = can be written as p/q (q ≠ 0)</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Fraction to Decimal</p>\n            <p>Divide numerator by denominator</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700\">Decimal to Fraction</p>\n            <p>Write over power of 10, simplify</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-orange-700\">Simplifying</p>\n            <p>Divide both by GCD</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} .accordion-content{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.3s ease-out;}.accordion-content.open{max-height:2000px;}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}